OL,3,GNEWSAMayor expects update on
OL,4,Aunderground station plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreater Manchester mayor Bev Craig says
OL,7,Fshe is hoping the government is ready
OL,8,Fto confirm by Christmas that it will
OL,9,Fbuild a new underground rail station at
OL,10,FManchester Piccadilly.
OL,12,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham called for
OL,13,Fthe station to go underground during
OL,14,Fhis time as Craig's predecessor in a
OL,15,Fmove he said would make the station the
OL,16,F"Kings Cross of the north of England."
OL,18,FThe proposal would play a part in
OL,19,Fboosting rail travel, supporting the
OL,20,F#45bn Northern Powerhouse Rail project,
OL,21,Fhe said.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
