OL,3,GNEWSAMayor expects update on
OL,4,Aunderground station plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on BBC Radio Manchester's Hot
OL,7,FSeat programme, Craig said: "The answer
OL,8,Fto a lot of our transport problems in
OL,9,Fthe city is an underground Piccadilly
OL,10,FStation that is fit for the future."
